  "body": "## Summary\n\n- add a runnable SASL/PLAIN example for a combined KRaft broker and controller\n- document `sasl.mechanism.controller.protocol` and the required per-listener JAAS configuration\n- correct the controller-endpoint explanation to reference `controller.quorum.bootstrap.servers`\n- warn that `SASL_PLAINTEXT` does not provide encryption and link to the mechanism-specific SASL guidance\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- formatted and started a standalone Kafka 4.4.0 KRaft cluster with the documented controller and broker SASL settings\n- authenticated directly to the controller with `kafka-metadata-quorum.sh ... describe --status`\n- authenticated to the broker and created and described a topic with `kafka-topics.sh`\n\nThis contribution is my original work, and I license it to the Apache Kafka project under the project's open source license.\n\nJIRA: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14369",
